From: ACK72 <acikom72@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 22:56:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: fairly service pending frames and batch ordinary TX kicks

Bound and fairly schedule pending traffic across shared radios without
stranding data capacity. Batch ordinary same-queue TX doorbells in groups
of four; flush control, power-save, status and off-channel traffic promptly
and flush on every exit, queue change, error or budget boundary.

Consolidates former ACK72 patches 0016, 0028.

